Z||000003||Eric||08-04-99||06:48 PM||||I think it's more like 350.  I picked up the block today off the engine stand.  I was ready for the thing to drop the ground when the bolts were pulled out, but it didn't.  In fact, I just about throw the thing into the rear window of the truck I was loading it into.  I figure about 80lbs for the stripped block.  I could be wrong because I'm really strong.  Now, since there is no engine/cradle in my GT, I don't have to go the the gym anymore because can bench what's left of the Fiero.
